    <h2>What we look for</h2>
    <p>Consistent quality, honest capacity estimates, and a willingness to work to the grading and documentation standards an export buyer expects. We work across fresh produce, grains, pulses, spices, seafood, animal feed ingredients and organic manure/fertilizer inputs — if you produce or process any of these, we want to hear from you.</p>

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol style="list-style:decimal;padding-inline-start:1.4em;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.8em">
      <li>Submit your details below — product, location, approximate capacity.</li>
      <li>We review submissions against current buyer demand and sourcing gaps.</li>
      <li>If there's a fit, we'll follow up to discuss grading standards, quantities and a trial order.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>We can't guarantee a response to every submission, but we do review new supplier details regularly, especially for products where we're actively sourcing additional capacity.</p>
